<Base title="Partners & Sponsors" description="Explore founding sponsorships, in-kind contributions, and community partnerships with GEAR Moto Foundation.">
<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Build the Mission Together</div><h1>Partnerships That<br/><span class="accent">Make a Difference.</span></h1></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Where Your Support Can Go</h2><p class="lede">The development plan calls for a broad base of individuals, sponsors, in-kind partners, and events—not reliance on a single donor. Support can help develop four distinct programs.</p><div class="cards gear-grid gear-balanced-four">
<article class="card"><h3>Gear</h3><p>Helmets, protective apparel, safety-equipment vouchers and access partnerships.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Education</h3><p>Rider training, course scholarships, and endorsement-related education.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Assistance</h3><p>Practical navigation, referrals, community-resource information, and service connections.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Recovery</h3><p>Planned Rider Relief medical grants, financial hardship support, rehabilitation, and rebuilding resources.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ways to Partner</h2><figure class="editorial-photo"><img src="/images/gear-moto-foundation-motorcycle-gear-sponsorship-partnership.jpg" alt="Concept image of a rider and motorcycle equipment partner discussing protective gear in a motorcycle shop." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1672" height="941"/><figcaption>Illustrative partnership discussion; no real sponsor relationship is implied.</figcaption></figure><div class="cards gear-balanced-four"><article class="card"><h3>Corporate Sponsors</h3><p>Annual and event-specific sponsorships with mission-focused, value-neutral recognition.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Gear &amp; Training Partners</h3><p>Help expand access to safe equipment and approved rider education through products, vouchers, discounts, and courses.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Community Hosts</h3><p>Restaurants, coffee shops, dealerships and other venues can explore responsibly planned charitable promotions and rider gatherings.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Medical &amp; Recovery Partners</h3><p>Healthcare, rehabilitation, mobility and support organizations can explore appropriate resource and service relationships.</p></article></div>
<div class="gear-partner-process" aria-labelledby="partner-next-title"><h2 id="partner-next-title">From an Introduction to a Meaningful Partnership</h2><p>We're currently welcoming conversations with motorcycle businesses, training providers, community venues and potential funding partners. Formal sponsorship agreements, donor acknowledgments, and promotional arrangements will follow organizational approvals.</p><ol><li><strong>Connect:</strong> Tell us what your organization does and which of GEAR's four pillars you care about.</li><li><strong>Explore:</strong> Discuss practical opportunities such as protective equipment, rider training access, community outreach, or recovery resources.</li><li><strong>Confirm:</strong> Document scope, permitted recognition, safeguards, and any financial commitments only when GEAR is authorized to enter the arrangement.</li></ol><p><a href="/governance/">Review our governance and development status ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="program-callout"><strong>Sponsor integrity:</strong> Sponsors cannot choose individual grant recipients or access confidential rider applications. Advertising and substantial promotional benefits must be distinguished from charitable acknowledgments. Sponsorship offerings and availability are subject to review.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="mailto:partner@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Partnership%20Inquiry">Start a Partnership Conversation</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/donate/">Other Ways to Support</a></div><p>Contact our partnerships team: <a href="mailto:partner@gearmotofoundation.org">partner@gearmotofoundation.org</a></p></div></section></Base><style>
